WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Now everyone listens to me when building a greenhouse.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,320
You can do whatever I tell you to do

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,960
I hope everyone can cooperate better

4
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:07,600
After all, you have to do things well when you are helping your boss.

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,720
Sorry to bother everyone

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:11,280
Now let me assign tasks to you

7
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,400
You two go carry the heavy stuff over here.

8
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:26,130
This kind of physical fitness is indeed not something ordinary people can have.

9
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:28,330
I didn’t ask you to move so much at once

10
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,730
No need to force it

11
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:32,450
It's not worth treating your body like it's okay if you ruin it

12
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:36,310
You are such a good man

13
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:38,150
Why do you come to do such hard work?

14
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:39,150
Judging from the skin

15
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,350
I have to admit that Xiao Zhenbei is indeed outstanding

16
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:43,310
It's just that this job can't be brought to the table.

17
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:47,000
Otherwise I wouldn’t object to them being together, Mr. Zhu

18
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,360
Many people in this world are helpless

19
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,560
It’s not that I can be whatever I want to be

20
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,440
You said this to me today from a high place

21
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:54,960
It seems a bit natural

22
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,160
I don’t know the sufferings of the people anymore
